    status: external_runtime_required
    notes: "Default enabled for the confirmed BF63112 module; preserve user disable and Steam PIN fallback. Source: FlightDan/FingerprintUnlock-SteamOS@fde8fa62bbad0318a9a8be88cc77bb4c3b4f919e; public lock: common/fingerprint/public-bridge-lock.json. X2 reset electrical behavior is not verified; no reset GPIO is configured."
